# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# www.clellandmaths.com is currently a Google Site (CNAME -> ghs.googlehosted.com)
# with its own URLs, all of which Google has indexed. When this site takes over
# that hostname those URLs stop existing, and without these lines every one of
# them 404s and loses whatever ranking it has built up.
#
# 301, not 302: the moves are permanent, and only a 301 passes ranking on.
#
# A first pass listed only the eight pages in the top nav. A proper crawl found
# fourteen — the extra six are course sub-pages, and one of those
# (/national-5-maths/n5-maths-past-papers) is linked from nowhere at all and
# only turned up by guessing the URL. So the per-course wildcards below matter
# more than the exact list: an orphan nobody has linked for years can still be
# sitting in Google's index, and the wildcard catches it whether we knew about
# it or not.
#
# Order matters — Cloudflare takes the first match, so specific rules come
# before the wildcard that would otherwise swallow them.

# ── National 5 Maths ────────────────────────────────────────────────
/national-5-maths/n5-maths-past-papers        /course/n5                   301
/national-5-maths                             /course/n5                   301
/national-5-maths/*                           /course/n5                   301

# ── Higher Maths ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/higher-maths/higher-maths-past-papers        /course/higher               301
/higher-maths/higher-2025-practice-papers     /exam-hall                   301
/higher-maths                                 /course/higher               301
/higher-maths/*                               /course/higher               301

# ── Advanced Higher ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
/ah-maths/ah-2025-practice-papers             /exam-hall                   301
/ah-maths                                     /course/ah                   301
/ah-maths/*                                   /course/ah                   301

# ── National 5 Applications ─────────────────────────────────────────
/national-5-applications-of-maths/n5-apps-practice-papers  /exam-hall      301
/national-5-applications-of-maths             /course/n5-apps              301
/national-5-applications-of-maths/*           /course/n5-apps              301

# ── Higher Applications ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# No sub-pages found, but it is the same shape of page as the other four and
# an unlinked child would look exactly like the National 5 one did.
/higher-applications-of-maths                 /course/higher-apps          301
/higher-applications-of-maths/*               /course/higher-apps          301

# ── top-level pages ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
/home                                         /                            301
# /connect already exists here at the same path, so it needs no rule.

# His own practice papers. Exam Hall is the closest equivalent — it holds the
# revision marathons and the paper archive.
/2026-practice-papers                         /exam-hall                   301
/2026-practice-papers/*                       /exam-hall                   301

# ── common guesses and old shapes ───────────────────────────────────
# Cheap to add, and they catch links typed from memory or printed on handouts.
/national5                                    /course/n5                   301
/national-5                                   /course/n5                   301
/n5                                           /course/n5                   301
/higher                                       /course/higher               301
/advanced-higher                              /course/ah                   301
/ah                                           /course/ah                   301
/n5-apps                                      /course/n5-apps              301
/higher-apps                                  /course/higher-apps          301
/papers                                       /exam-hall                   301
/past-papers                                  /exam-hall                   301
/notes                                        /course/n5/notes             301
